#: admin/hosting-fields/index.php:128
msgid "For example, if you were working in a corporate environment and wanted to keep a record of who purchased each of your hosting services, you could create a Purchaser Name text field and keep track of this information for every one of your hosting services. And when you export your hosting data, the information contained in your custom fields will automatically be included in the exported data."
