#: classes/DomainMOD/WatchLifecycle.php:209
msgid "Newly registered"
msgstr "নতুন নিবন্ধিত"

#. TRANSLATORS: a Watch List column heading, short for the domain's registration date, beside "Expiry"
#: classes/DomainMOD/WatchLifecycle.php:210 classes/DomainMOD/WatchListColumns.php:70
